{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>They do not</b> — those who remain, and even if they had [offerings], they would not be pleasing to Him." "<b>Like bread of mourning</b> — like לא אכלתי באוני (I did not eat in my mourning). It is a noun, and אונים is plural form."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:39.433426361Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}